(property "Description" "binder M8 A-coded 3-contact receptacle: contacts 1, 3 and 4, there is no contact 2 (data sheet p.1, plug-in side: 4 at the top, 3 left, 1 right); lead colours 1 brown, 3 blue, 4 black. | design | W425 (E4) is the cable plugged into J551: field-wired M8 male plug 99 3379 100 03 at this end (its contacts 1/3/4 mirror the receptacle), USB-C into the pod (R-E5-09). The receptacle is the female (socket) half, so the live 5 V contact is shrouded.; Lead colours are binder's (1 brown, 3 blue, 4 black): the black lead is the unused contact 4, not GND; insulate it at the PWR end. Map W425 by contact number, not by colour (its black conductor is GND).; Keying: M8 shell differs from GX16-4 J504 and GX12 J505, so neither the IMU nor the LAB BUS plug enters it (build/15 'Ключування панельних роз'ємів'). Unshielded version: no shell or shield contact; the housing is not bonded (ASA wall, power-only cable)." (at 0 0 0) (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016)) (hide yes)))
