(text "Project locking connector/GX16 numbers have been assigned but final keyed part footprints/orientation and wire\nlengths are not released; the J551 pod power receptacle (M8 3-pin, contacts 1/3/4) still needs its wall\nposition and a confirmed mounting side (MECH-07).\nВорота (стенд): Record exact supplier part numbers, face-view and wire-color tables; no-power continuity plus\nfirst energization current limit." (at 273.05 38.93 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 050757ac-5c3d-5a04-a668-f2c33f2611d3))
